cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "Pepforge: An Integrated Peptide Research Workbench"
message: "If you use Pepforge, Pepforge-generated outputs, or Pepforge-derived workflows in academic work, please cite this repository and the corresponding release DOI when available."
type: software
authors:
