date-released: "2026-06-19"
abstract: "Pepforge is an integrated peptide research workbench for hotspot analysis, SPPS-aware peptide design, synthesis planning, modified-peptide structure generation, docking-oriented screening, external validation bridging, and publication-oriented evidence reporting."
keywords:
  - peptide design
  - SPPS
  - docking
  - molecular dynamics
  - peptide synthesis
  - bioinformatics
